%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-coercions-functions-todate (関数ページ)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import * from dw::util::Coercions
output application/dw
---
{
  a: toDate("2015-10-01"),
  b: toDate("2003/10/01","uuuu/MM/dd")
}
%%% output application/dw
{
  a: |2015-10-01|,
  b: |2003-10-01| as Date {format: "uuuu/MM/dd"}
}
